    "body_text": "Skip to content Buy Rent House Prices Find Agent Commercial Inspire Overseas Sign in Sign in Buy Property for sale New homes for sale Property valuation Investors Mortgages Rent Property to rent Student property to rent Find Agent Find estate agents House prices Sold house prices Instant online valuation Commercial Commercial property to rent Commercial property for sale Advertise Inspire Moving stories Property news Energy efficiency Property guides Housing trends Overseas blog Mortgage guides Overseas All countries Spain France Portugal Italy Greece Currency Sell Overseas property See similar properties Property photo 1 of 17. 1/17 Lancaster Road, Wimbledon, London, SW19 £16,500 pcm £3,808 pw Tenancy info Added on 12/05/2026 Letting details Let available date: 20/07/2026 Deposit: £22,846 Furnish type: Unfurnished Council Tax: Ask agent PROPERTY TYPE Semi-Detached BEDROOMS 6 BATHROOMS 6 SIZE 5,344 sq ft 496 sq m 1 +11 Key features Six double bedroomsKitchen/breakfast roomFormal reception roomDining roomPlayroomOffice and cinema roomPrivate GardenGated parkingEPC Rating = B Description A stunning, semi detached, six bedroom family house in a prime village address location. Description This stunning semi-detached six-bedroom residence offers approximately 5,500 sq ft of beautifully appointed living space, The ground floor welcomes you with an impressive entrance hall complete with a seating area, leading to a formal reception room and an elegant dining room. The spacious kitchen/breakfast room opens directly onto the landscaped rear garden, and a stylish cloakroom completes this level. The lower ground floor is designed for both comfort and versatility, featuring a gym or office space, a cinema room with integrated bar, a playroom, and a practical utility room. There is also self-contained accommodation ideal for a nanny or guest, including a private entrance, kitchenette, and en suite shower room. Upstairs, the principal bedroom suite boasts a luxurious en suite bathroom and a dressing area. Five additional double bedrooms and four further bath/shower rooms ensure ample space for family and guests, while a second kitchen adds further flexibility to the layout. The property benefits from gated off-street parking to the front, offering both convenience and privacy. Applicant note The photos provided are over 6 months old. Location Lancaster Road is a quiet residential road located in the heart of Wimbledon Village. Wimbledon Village is known for its uniquely rural feel with 1,200 acres of Wimbledon Common bordering the High Street alongside pretty boutiques, restaurants and bars. The All England Lawn Tennis Club is approximately 1,000 metres away. Central London can be reached from Wimbledon railway station, around 1,200 metres away with a regular link to London Waterloo. Locally are a number of popular schools including King's College School and Wimbledon High School. Square Footage: 5,344 sq ft Additional Info Holding Deposit: £3,807.69 ( 1 week ) Deposit Payable: £22,846.15 ( 6 weeks ) Minimum Term if Non Housing Act Tenancy: 12 months Rent must be paid monthly in advance Brochures Web Details Particulars Read full description COUNCIL TAX Band: H PARKING Yes GARDEN Yes ACCESSIBILITY Ask agent Energy Performance Certificate Utilities, rights & restrictions Lancaster Road, Wimbledon, London, SW19 Approximate location Open map Street View My places Stations Schools Add an important place to see how long it'd take to get there from our property listings. __mins driving to your place Broadband speed About Savills Lettings, Wimbledon 1 High Street Wimbledon London SW19 5DX Founded in 1855, Savills is a leading global estate agency with over 130 locations around the UK including 37 offices in London. Whether buying, selling, letting or renting a property, our experienced estate agents take the time to understand your property needs and guide you through every step of the process. We also provide an array of special