    "description": "A stunning, semi detached, six bedroom family house in a prime village address location. Description This stunning semi-detached six-bedroom residence offers approximately 5,500 sq ft of beautifully appointed living space, The ground floor welcomes you with an impressive entrance hall complete with a seating area, leading to a formal reception room and an elegant dining room. The spacious kitchen/breakfast room opens directly onto the landscaped rear garden, and a stylish cloakroom completes this level. The lower ground floor is designed for both comfort and versatility, featuring a gym or office space, a cinema room with integrated bar, a playroom, and a practical utility room. There is also self-contained accommodation ideal for a nanny or guest, including a private entrance, kitchenette, and en suite shower room. Upstairs, the principal bedroom suite boasts a luxurious en suite bathroom and a dressing area. Five additional double bedrooms and four further bath/shower rooms ensure ample space for family and guests, while a second kitchen adds further flexibility to the layout. The property benefits from gated off-street parking to the front, offering both convenience and privacy. Applicant note The photos provided are over 6 months old. Location Lancaster Road is a quiet residential road located in the heart of Wimbledon Village. Wimbledon Village is known for its uniquely rural feel with 1,200 acres of Wimbledon Common bordering the High Street alongside pretty boutiques, restaurants and bars. The All England Lawn Tennis Club is approximately 1,000 metres away. Central London can be reached from Wimbledon railway station, around 1,200 metres away with a regular link to London Waterloo. Locally are a number of popular schools including King's College School and Wimbledon High School. Square Footage: 5,344 sq ft Additional Info Holding Deposit: £3,807.69 ( 1 week ) Deposit Payable: £22,846.15 ( 6 weeks ) Minimum Term if Non Housing Act Tenancy: 